/*
  protocol/compute_opresult.spthy -- thin EFFECT ADAPTER for the agnostic compute behaviour (AGNOSTIC_MASKS.md).
  The P4 infer_harness manifests a compute response as OpResult (consumed by Finish_op), where the real
  protocol uses KeyResult. Same generic Respond(P,rid,value) source; different ceremony fact. One line.
*/

rule Compute_to_OpResult:
    [ Respond(P, rid, v) ]
  -->
    [ OpResult(P, rid, v) ]
